{"title":"Lapis lazuli","sourceTitle":"Lapis lazuli/pt-br","html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"pt-BR\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"mw-pt-languages noprint navigation-not-searchable\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"mw-pt-languages-label\">Other languages:</div><ul class=\"mw-pt-languages-list\"><li><a href=\"/Lapis_lazuli\" class=\"mw-pt-languages-ui mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--complete\" title=\"Lapis lazuli (100% translated)\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">English</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Lapis_lazuli/es\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--low\" title=\"Lapislázuli (6% translated)\" lang=\"es\" dir=\"ltr\">español</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Lapis_lazuli/fr\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--low\" title=\"Lapis-lazuli (9% translated)\" lang=\"fr\" dir=\"ltr\">français</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Lapis_lazuli/it\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--low\" title=\"Lapislazuli (3% translated)\" lang=\"it\" dir=\"ltr\">italiano</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"mw-pt-languages-selected mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--low\" lang=\"pt-BR\" dir=\"ltr\">português do Brasil</span></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Lapis_lazuli/ru\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--low\" title=\"Лазурит (9% translated)\" lang=\"ru\" dir=\"ltr\">русский</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Lapis_lazuli/zh\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--low\" title=\"青金石 (9% translated)\" lang=\"zh\" dir=\"ltr\">中文</a></li></ul></div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;float:right;\">\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"position:relative; border-radius:7px; font-size:90%; width:300px; float:right; margin-left:5px; margin-bottom: 5px;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#000000\" colspan=\"2\" style=\"border-top-right-radius:7px; border-top-left-radius:7px; text-align:center; font-size:13.5px;\"><font color=\"white\"><b><span class=\"mw-translate-fuzzy\">Lápis-lazúli</span></b></font>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#d3ab92\" colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Ore-lapislazuli.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/9/94/Ore-lapislazuli.png/100px-Ore-lapislazuli.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/9/94/Ore-lapislazuli.png/150px-Ore-lapislazuli.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/9/94/Ore-lapislazuli.png/200px-Ore-lapislazuli.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Empilhável</b>\n</td>\n<td>64\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#000000\" colspan=\"2\" class=\"Bloba\" style=\"text-align:center; font-size:13.5px; border-bottom-right-radius:7px; border-bottom-left-radius:7px;\"><a href=\"/Items\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Items\"><font color=\"white\"><b>Itens</b></font></a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table><br style=\"clear:both\" />\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"position:relative; border-radius:7px; font-size:90%; width:300px; float:right; margin-left:5px; margin-bottom: 5px;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#000000\" colspan=\"2\" style=\"border-top-right-radius:7px; border-top-left-radius:7px; text-align:center; font-size:13.5px;\"><font color=\"white\"><b>Lápis-lazúli moído</b></font>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#d3ab92\" colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Crushed-lapislazuli.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/b/b0/Crushed-lapislazuli.png/100px-Crushed-lapislazuli.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/b/b0/Crushed-lapislazuli.png/150px-Crushed-lapislazuli.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/b/b0/Crushed-lapislazuli.png/200px-Crushed-lapislazuli.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Empilhável</b>\n</td>\n<td>64\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#000000\" colspan=\"2\" class=\"Bloba\" style=\"text-align:center; font-size:13.5px; border-bottom-right-radius:7px; border-bottom-left-radius:7px;\"><a href=\"/Items\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Items\"><font color=\"white\"><b>Itens</b></font></a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table><br style=\"clear:both\" />\n</div>\n<div class=\"mw-translate-fuzzy\">\n<p><b>Lapis lazuli</b> é um pigmento que pode ser criado a partir do minério de lápis-lazúli. É usado para <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Dye\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Dye\">morrendo</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Dye\" title=\"Dye\"> </a></span> e para escrever em placas.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Criação\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Criação</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Buying\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Buying</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Uso\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Uso</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Pigment\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Pigment</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Dye\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Dye</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Selling\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Selling</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#History\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">History</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Notes\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Notes</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Gallery\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Gallery</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#References\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">References</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<p><span id=\"Obtaining\"></span>\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-translate-fuzzy\">\n<h2><span id=\"Cria.C3.A7.C3.A3o\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Criação\">Criação</span></h2>\n</div>\n<div lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">\n<p>Lapis lazuli can be found in the following <a href=\"/Rock/pt-br\" title=\"Rock/pt-br\">rock</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Rock/pt-br\" title=\"Rock/pt-br\"> </a></span> types: limestone, white marble, green marble, and red marble. Lapis lazuli <a href=\"/Ore_Deposits/pt-br\" title=\"Ore Deposits/pt-br\">ore deposits</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Ore_Deposits/pt-br\" title=\"Ore Deposits/pt-br\"> </a></span> generate at an elevation between 0.05 and 0.85 of the surface. The height of the surface varies across different terrain, and is estimated to be Y = 120 on average in a world with default height settings. Lapis lazuli can range from Y= 6 to Y = 102. The deposit is disc-shaped with a radius of 1-12 blocks and a thickness of 1 block. It has 5 tries per chunk to generate, making it rare.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> Lapis lazuli bits on the surface indicate a deposit within 10 rock blocks below.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"noresize\">\n<table class=\"wikitable mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" style=\"width: 530px; text-align: center;\">\n<caption><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">Lapis lazuli in host rock</span>\n</caption>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">Rock</span>\n</th>\n<th><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">Normal block</span>\n</th>\n<th><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">Ore block</span>\n</th>\n<th><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">Lapis lazuli bits</span>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">Limestone</span>\n</td>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Rock-limestone.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/0/00/Rock-limestone.png/100px-Rock-limestone.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/0/00/Rock-limestone.png/150px-Rock-limestone.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/0/00/Rock-limestone.png/200px-Rock-limestone.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Ore-lapislazuli-limestone.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/1/1f/Ore-lapislazuli-limestone.png/100px-Ore-lapislazuli-limestone.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/1/1f/Ore-lapislazuli-limestone.png/150px-Ore-lapislazuli-limestone.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/1/1f/Ore-lapislazuli-limestone.png/200px-Ore-lapislazuli-limestone.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Looseores-lapislazuli-limestone.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/9/9d/Looseores-lapislazuli-limestone.png/100px-Looseores-lapislazuli-limestone.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/9/9d/Looseores-lapislazuli-limestone.png/150px-Looseores-lapislazuli-limestone.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/9/9d/Looseores-lapislazuli-limestone.png/200px-Looseores-lapislazuli-limestone.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">White marble</span>\n</td>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Rock-whitemarble.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/6/6e/Rock-whitemarble.png/100px-Rock-whitemarble.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/6/6e/Rock-whitemarble.png/150px-Rock-whitemarble.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/6/6e/Rock-whitemarble.png/200px-Rock-whitemarble.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Ore-lapislazuli-whitemarble.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/5/50/Ore-lapislazuli-whitemarble.png/100px-Ore-lapislazuli-whitemarble.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/5/50/Ore-lapislazuli-whitemarble.png/150px-Ore-lapislazuli-whitemarble.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/5/50/Ore-lapislazuli-whitemarble.png/200px-Ore-lapislazuli-whitemarble.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Looseores-lapislazuli-whitemarble.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/9/90/Looseores-lapislazuli-whitemarble.png/100px-Looseores-lapislazuli-whitemarble.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/9/90/Looseores-lapislazuli-whitemarble.png/150px-Looseores-lapislazuli-whitemarble.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/9/90/Looseores-lapislazuli-whitemarble.png/200px-Looseores-lapislazuli-whitemarble.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">Green marble</span>\n</td>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Rock-greenmarble.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/8/89/Rock-greenmarble.png/100px-Rock-greenmarble.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/8/89/Rock-greenmarble.png/150px-Rock-greenmarble.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/8/89/Rock-greenmarble.png/200px-Rock-greenmarble.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Ore-lapislazuli-greenmarble.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/f/f2/Ore-lapislazuli-greenmarble.png/100px-Ore-lapislazuli-greenmarble.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/f/f2/Ore-lapislazuli-greenmarble.png/150px-Ore-lapislazuli-greenmarble.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/f/f2/Ore-lapislazuli-greenmarble.png/200px-Ore-lapislazuli-greenmarble.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Looseores-lapislazuli-greenmarble.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/2/2b/Looseores-lapislazuli-greenmarble.png/100px-Looseores-lapislazuli-greenmarble.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/2/2b/Looseores-lapislazuli-greenmarble.png/150px-Looseores-lapislazuli-greenmarble.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/2/2b/Looseores-lapislazuli-greenmarble.png/200px-Looseores-lapislazuli-greenmarble.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">Red marble</span>\n</td>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Rock-redmarble.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/0/03/Rock-redmarble.png/100px-Rock-redmarble.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/0/03/Rock-redmarble.png/150px-Rock-redmarble.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/0/03/Rock-redmarble.png/200px-Rock-redmarble.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Ore-lapislazuli-pinkmarble.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/1/13/Ore-lapislazuli-pinkmarble.png/100px-Ore-lapislazuli-pinkmarble.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/1/13/Ore-lapislazuli-pinkmarble.png/150px-Ore-lapislazuli-pinkmarble.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/1/13/Ore-lapislazuli-pinkmarble.png/200px-Ore-lapislazuli-pinkmarble.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Looseores-lapislazuli-redmarble.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/1/1f/Looseores-lapislazuli-redmarble.png/100px-Looseores-lapislazuli-redmarble.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/1/1f/Looseores-lapislazuli-redmarble.png/150px-Looseores-lapislazuli-redmarble.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/1/1f/Looseores-lapislazuli-redmarble.png/200px-Looseores-lapislazuli-redmarble.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<div lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">\n<p>A tier 2 <a href=\"/Pickaxe/pt-br\" title=\"Pickaxe/pt-br\">pickaxe</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Pickaxe/pt-br\" title=\"Pickaxe/pt-br\"> </a></span> (<a href=\"/Copper/pt-br\" title=\"Copper/pt-br\">copper</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Copper/pt-br\" title=\"Copper/pt-br\"> </a></span> or higher) or an <a href=\"/Ore_blasting_bomb/pt-br\" title=\"Ore blasting bomb/pt-br\">ore blasting bomb</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Ore_blasting_bomb/pt-br\" title=\"Ore blasting bomb/pt-br\"> </a></span> is required to mine lapis lazuli.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Buying\">Buying</span></h3>\n</div>\n<div lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">\n<p>6 rough lapis lazuli can be purchased from a <a href=\"/Trading#Treasure_Hunter/pt-br\" title=\"Trading\">treasure hunter</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Trading#Treasure_Hunter/pt-br\" title=\"Trading\"> </a></span> for 1 to 2 <a href=\"/Rusty_gears/pt-br\" title=\"Rusty gears/pt-br\">rusty gears</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Rusty_gears/pt-br\" title=\"Rusty gears/pt-br\"> </a></span>. While in stock, this trade can be performed 3 to 5 times per reset.\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><span id=\"Usage\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Uso\">Uso</span></h2>\n<div lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Pigment\">Pigment</span></h3>\n</div>\n<div lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">\n<dl><dd><i>See also: <a href=\"/Pigment/pt-br\" title=\"Pigment/pt-br\">Pigmento</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Pigment/pt-br\" title=\"Pigment/pt-br\"> </a></span></i></dd></dl>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mw-translate-fuzzy\">\n<p>O lápis-lazúli é um <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/pigment\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/pigment\">pigmento</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Pigment\" title=\"Pigment\"> </a></span> que pode ser usado para <abbr title=\"Esgueirar-se, o padrão é shift e clicar com o botão direito\">escrever</abbr> em <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/sign\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/sign\">assinares</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Sign\" title=\"Sign\"> </a></span>, <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Parchment#Label\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Parchment\">caixas rotuladas</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Parchment#Label\" title=\"Parchment\"> </a></span>, etc... e para desenhar símbolos em paredes.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Dye\">Dye</span></h3>\n</div>\n<div lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">\n<dl><dd><i>See also: <a href=\"/Dye/pt-br\" title=\"Dye/pt-br\">Tingir</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Dye/pt-br\" title=\"Dye/pt-br\"> </a></span></i></dd></dl>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mw-translate-fuzzy\">\n<p>O lápis-lazúli deve primeiro ser <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Pulverizer\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Pulverizer\">pulverizado</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Pulverizer\" title=\"Pulverizer\"> </a></span> transformado em lápis-lazúli triturado com um pulverizador Nível 2 antes de poder ser usado para <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Dye\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Dye\">morrendo</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Dye\" title=\"Dye\"> </a></span>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mw-translate-fuzzy\">\n<p>Lápis-lazúli triturado pode ser usado para criar <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Dye\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Dye\">corante azul</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Dye\" title=\"Dye\"> </a></span>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Selling\">Selling</span></h3>\n</div>\n<div lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">\n<p>Lapis lazuli can be sold to the following traders:\n</p>\n<ul><li>An <a href=\"/Trading#Artisan/pt-br\" title=\"Trading\">artisan trader</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Trading#Artisan/pt-br\" title=\"Trading\"> </a></span> purchases 10 rough lapis lazuli for 1 to 2 rusty gears. This trade can be performed 3 to 5 times per reset.</li>\n<li>A <a href=\"/Trading#Luxuries/pt-br\" title=\"Trading\">luxuries trader</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Trading#Luxuries/pt-br\" title=\"Trading\"> </a></span> purchases 4 rough lapis lazuli for 1 to 2 rusty gears. This trade can be performed 3 to 7 times per reset.</li>\n<li>The <a href=\"/Villager#Tailor/pt-br\" title=\"Villager\">tailor</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Villager#Tailor/pt-br\" title=\"Villager\"> </a></span> purchases 1 rough lapis lazuli for 2 to 4 rusty gears. This trade can be performed 3 to 5 times per reset.</li></ul>\n</div>\n<div lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"History\">History</span></h2>\n</div>\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r285111\">.mw-parser-output .history th[scope=col]{background-color:#5E462A;color:#EAD3B3;border:2px solid #382b1e;text-align:center}.mw-parser-output .history td{border:transparent}.mw-parser-output .history th[scope=row]{background-color:#D1B296;text-align:center}.mw-parser-output .history tr:nth-child(2n/**/+1) td{background-color:#CCBCAB}.mw-parser-output .history tr:nth-child(2n) td{background-color:#E0CFBB}</style>\n<strong class=\"error\"><span class=\"scribunto-error mw-scribunto-error-112edf4d\">Lua error in Module:History at line 30: attempt to index local &#39;version&#39; (a nil value).</span></strong><table class=\"wikitable history\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th scope=\"col\" colspan=\"2\">Versão\n</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">Descrição\n</th></tr>\n\n</tbody></table>\n<div lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span></h2>\n</div>\n<div lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">\n<ul><li>Contrary to the <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Prospecting_pick\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Prospecting pick\">prospecting pick</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Prospecting_pick\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Prospecting pick\"> </a></span>’s item description, lapis lazuli ore can be detected through <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/prospecting\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/prospecting\">prospecting</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Prospecting\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Prospecting\"> </a></span>.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></li>\n<li>Contrary to the Survival Handbook, lapis lazuli does not generate in bauxite rock.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-3\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></li>\n<li>Crushed lapis lazuli can be ground into powdered lapis lazuli in a <a href=\"/Quern/pt-br\" title=\"Quern/pt-br\">quern</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Quern/pt-br\" title=\"Quern/pt-br\"> </a></span>. However, this item currently has no usage.</li></ul>\n</div>\n<div lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n</div>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-nolines\">\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 125px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 120px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Powder-lapislazuli.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Powdered lapis lazuli\"><img alt=\"Powdered lapis lazuli\" src=\"/images/thumb/4/4f/Powder-lapislazuli.png/120px-Powder-lapislazuli.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/4/4f/Powder-lapislazuli.png/180px-Powder-lapislazuli.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/4/4f/Powder-lapislazuli.png/240px-Powder-lapislazuli.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\"><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">Powdered lapis lazuli</span></div>\n\t\t</li>\n</ul>\n<div lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"References\">References</span></h2>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-1\">↑<